cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite this software and the accompanying manuscript."
type: software
title: "The rearrangement number: non(M) <= rr in Lean"
authors:
  - family-names: "de Oliveira Rodrigues"
    given-names: "Vinicius"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A standalone Lean 4 and mathlib formalization of non(M) <= rr, with
  non(M) defined using the meagre ideal on the real line and rr using
  rearranging families of permutations of the natural numbers.
  Formalizes the lower bound from Determining the Rearrangement Number.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - rearrangement number
  - cardinal characteristics
  - Baire category
